# The Rust source (bindings/, core/, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, .cargo/) IS published so that
# scripts/postinstall.mjs can build the native addon from source on platforms without a prebuilt
# binary. The host-built binary itself is not shipped — it comes from the optionalDependencies on
# supported platforms, or is produced on install everywhere else.

